  Subtitle: Precursor ruins - the Swarm digs for something
  Briefing: 'Ruins of a civilization older than the Swarm. Its guardian still stands.

    The
    Guardian''s core is shielded by crystals: shatter them first, then strike the
    core.'
  Objectives: '- Cross the ruins

    - Defeat the Widow Prime

    - Shatter the
    crystals and destroy the Aether Guardian'
